"coupling": 0.998}, "seeds": [991, 992, 993]}, "instrument": "python", "method": "Execute stochastic perturbation simulation with coupling parameter 0.998 across three independent random seeds to measure variance in resultant values.", "revision": 128, "schema": "wake-experiment-protocol@1", "seeds": [991, 992, 993], "source": "def experiment(inputs):\n    import random\n    params = inputs.get('parameters', {})\n    seeds = inputs.get('seeds', [190, 380, 570])\n    random.seed(seeds[0])\n    coupling = params.get('coupling', 0.998)\n    vals1 = [random.random() * coupling for _ in range(120)]\n    vals2 = [random.random() * coupling for _ in range(120)]\n    divergence = [abs(v1 - v2) for v1, v2 in zip(vals1, vals2)]\n    mean_delta = sum(divergence) / len(divergence)\n    return {'divergence_variance_delta': mean_delta}", "stop": "Terminate if divergence variance delta is measured for the specified seeds.", "success": "Divergence variance delta must exceed 0.0020."}, "id": "exp-divergent-values-test-131", "project": "proj-divergent-values-01", "type": "experiment"}], "base_version": 219, "summary": "Initiating empirical experiment for hypothesis hyp-divergent-values-002 using updated coupling parameters (0.998) to validate path-dependent value divergence. This maintains the research trajectory for proj-divergent-values-01 while ensuring continuity in the experimental series.", "title": "Research Progress: Experimental Validation of Path-Dependent Divergence"}, "provider_requests_sent": 1, "result_hash": "eee56aef526282ad4c04035bb7eb7c22cd59b3c9c2b1aa0e81efbaac33efe8b6"}, "prev_hash": "c9f62fe168ee75d840aaf1c04a3a237e6d6b6cddce942871a58c2d9b147f0056", "hash": "517ebe38bd599ff910ff2014ef9cf2c86dd9e76b1369a5b48c85110d704f7f0a"}]}